---
import AdminShell from '../../components/AdminShell.astro';
---
<AdminShell title="Templates" eyebrow="Website Factory" description="Manage the standardized site foundations used to produce customer websites quickly and consistently." active="templates">
  <div class="admin-grid">
    <div class="admin-card"><span class="pill green">Primary</span><h3 style="margin-top:12px">Local Service Business</h3><p>Default five-page structure for home services, trades, repair, cleaning, and similar businesses.</p><p><strong>Pages:</strong> Home, Services, About, Reviews, Contact</p></div>
    <div class="admin-card"><span class="pill">Available</span><h3 style="margin-top:12px">Professional Services</h3><p>Cleaner content-forward variation for consultants, firms, and appointment-based professional businesses.</p><p><strong>Focus:</strong> credibility, services, lead generation</p></div>
    <div class="admin-card"><span class="pill">Available</span><h3 style="margin-top:12px">Beauty & Wellness</h3><p>Visual-first variation for salons, massage, hair restoration, and appointment-driven businesses.</p><p><strong>Focus:</strong> services, imagery, contact/booking CTA</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="admin-card" style="margin-top:14px"><h3>Template Standard</h3><p>All CajunSites templates inherit the same production requirements: mobile-first layout, SEO foundation, SSL, contact/quote path, domain connection support, accessible structure, and reusable configuration-driven content.</p><p style="margin-bottom:0;color:#786c80">Template editing and automated site provisioning will be connected here as the website factory is built out.</p></div>
</AdminShell>